"kind":"update","title":"Sushi on Wheels Demo Update V0.6.26","summary":"Sushi on Wheels Demo V0.6.26Hey there! Thank you so much to everyone that has played the demo so far! Thanks a lot for all the feedback and bug reports you sent. You have also sent me great ideas to put in the demo, and i’ve put some of those ideas into this update! This update focuses on addressing a lot of the issues that have been reported since the demo launched, alongside some new features, animation improvements, and general polish.There may still be some bugs remaining, so please keep rep","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T13:10:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498234196","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3749760-1844115010497597","game_id":"steam-3749760","kind":"announcement","title":"Sushi On Wheels Demo!","summary":"Hello, everyone!So happy to announce that the Demo for Sushi On Wheels is available now!! I hope you all enjoy making sushi for the locals of the Izu Peninsula! If you have any questions, come over and say hi in the discussions 👋 I'd love to hear from you! And if you have any feedback on the Demo, Please fill out this form! Thank you for coming along for the adventure! 🍣","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T17:56:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010497597","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3749760-1836506165568431","game_id":"steam-3749760","kind":"announcement","title":"Redrawing the World of Sushi On Wheels","summary":"Hello, everyone!Hey Everyone! We've been working really hard on getting a demo ready for the game!Recently I've been working on lots of back end systems for the game so haven't had a lot to show! However, I also gave the map of the Izu Peninsula a total overhaul! The world map is one of the first things you see before setting out in your sushi truck, so I wanted it to feel like more than a simple location select screen. Heres the map of the Izu Peninsula before! It was lacking detail and charact","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-02T15:58:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165568431","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3749760-1828441623104532","game_id":"steam-3749760","kind":"announcement","title":"🍣 Sushi On Wheels beta is in 1 week!!","summary":"Hello, everyone!It's just 1 week until the beta playtest! The playtest will take place from the 3rd of April 2026 until the 5th of April!For anyone unaware of how a beta playtest works, on the 3rd of April you'll be sent a key to access the beta through Steam, then on the 5th of April, access to the beta will be removed as the playtest ends. The playtest demo will only be in English, as I'm still putting together the translation system. You can sign up for the playtest here, there's limited spot","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-27T13:26:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623104532","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3749760-1826362059921766","game_id":"steam-3749760","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest sign ups open!","summary":"Hello, everyone!We're so excited to announce that sign ups for our beta playtest are open now!! The playtest starts at the end of March, so be sure to sign up as we have limited spots! https://subscribepage.io/SushiOnWheelsIf you have any questions, come over and say hi in the discussions 👋 I'd love to hear from you! And before you go, please consider wishlisting our game if you haven't already -- it lets us know how much interest there is, and helps the game gain visibility 💖Thank you for comin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-05T16:26:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059921766","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3749760-1824644522848259","game_id":"steam-3749760","kind":"update","title":"2026 Game update!","summary":"Hello, everyone!Hey Everyone! We've been working really hard on getting a demo ready for the game!Recently We've been working on the festival mechanic in the game.There'll be festivals to attend where you can meet other food truck vendors like at the Shirahama Festival! If you sell enough sushi and build your reputation you'll get invited to participate in local festivals! When selling sushi at a festival, you can walk around it first to talk to all the other food vendors, who might give you tip","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-17T17:30:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824644522848259","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3749760-1808061939490876","game_id":"steam-3749760","kind":"announcement","title":"Hey, everyone! 👋🥳 Welcome to Sushi On Wheels! 🍣","summary":"Hello, everyone!I'd like to extend our warmest welcome to everyone new, and also to those who have been following our game from its early stages. In case you haven't seen our announcement trailer yet, i've just revealed it! You can watch it below 👇Wow, it's so exciting to be showing it here on Steam!I'm aiming to actively post developer updates here! So follow us if you're curious about the game, and how it's going. If you have any questions, come over and say hi in the discussions 👋 I'd love to","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-19T05:19:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1808061939490876","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3749760":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:29Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:28Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3749760":"2026-10-26T10:59:29Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3749760":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:28Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:28Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:28Z"},"4665500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:29Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:29Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:29Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3749760","app_id":3749760,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:21Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"9b90569ccde57ef6e4ec53d8b89351f17d6f69fe9cad12a2f471e5470ecfd8dc","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"따뜻하고 여유로운 시뮬레이션 경영 게임입니다. 할머니의 초밥 푸드트럭을 물려받아 아름다운 섬에서 꿈을 펼쳐보세요. 식재료를 준비하고 트럭을 꾸미며, 지역 주민들에게 수제 초밥을 만들어 대접하세요. 끊임없이 명성을 쌓고 성대한 축제에 참여하여, 이즈 최고의 초밥 레스토랑을 열어보세요!","publishers":[{"name":"Rogue Duck Interactive","creator_clan_account_id":44794657},{"name":"Gamersky Games","creator_clan_account_id":42658688}],"developers":[{"name":"Greene Rapture"}],"franchises":[{"name":"RDI Strategy Games"}]},"release":{"steam_rele